===Draugr Deathlord===
[[File:SR-creature-Draugr Deathlord male.jpg|thumb|right|A Draugr Deathlord]]
Draugr Deathlords are the highest level common variant draugr to be found within Skyrim. They are the first of the two variants of draugr that carry powerful [[Skyrim:Ebony|ebony]] equipment, making them very dangerous opponents. Draugr Deathlords always wear their unique unobtainable version of the Ancient Nord Helmet, visually similar to the [[Skyrim:Helm of Yngol|Helm of Yngol]]. Their health and attacks are brutal on their own, but they also use [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|thu'um]] - and unlike their lesser counterparts, a Draugr Deathlord's [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]] shout is powerful enough to ragdoll you at times, making them even more of a challenge to the unprepared adventurer.
